  "ruleText": "Res 7303.07 Scuba Diving. No person shall scuba dive in designated swimming areas, nor in Archery Pond in Bear Brook state park.\n\nSource. #8532, eff 1-1-06 (from Res 7304.05); ss by #10532, eff 3-1-14",
